-- 2026-27 Cloverleaf throws templates. BRAIN.md [C136].
-- Built from the program's 2023-24, 2024-25 and 2025-26 calendars, with the review's fixes (load targets, deload,
-- testing, speed/plyo day, implement contrast, video, championship taper). Editable (built_in = 0), so coaches can
-- change or delete them like any custom template. Names carry the program's own phase labels so the library sorts in
-- season order: M0 intro week, M1 general prep, M2 specific prep, M3 competition, M4 championship; "(any phase)"
-- for days used all season.

